      "code": "G",
      "title": "Past simple",
      "rule": "Oʻtgan zamon — oʻtgan vaqtda tugagan ish-harakat (*yesterday, last week, last night*). Toʻgʻri feʼllarga *-ed* qoʻshiladi: *work → worked, play → played, live → lived, study → studied.* Notoʻgʻri feʼllarni yodlaymiz: *go → went, have → had, see → saw, eat → ate, buy → bought, make → made, get → got, come → came, take → took, give → gave, meet → met, write → wrote, read → read, sleep → slept, drink → drank.* *be* feʼli: *was* (I, he, she, it), *were* (you, we, they). Inkor: *didn't + asosiy shakl* (*I didn't go*); soʻroq: *Did you go?* — *Yes, I did. / No, I didn't.*",
      "examples": [
        "I visited Samarkand last week.",
        "Dilnoza worked at school yesterday.",
        "Bekzod went to the park.",
        "We were at home last night.",
        "I didn't see Aziz yesterday.",
        "Did you buy some bread?"
      ],
      "words": [
