      ],
      "text": {
        "title": "Yesterday",
        "en": "Yesterday was Sunday. Dilnoza didn't work. She got up at nine. She had breakfast with her family. Then she went to the market with Nodira. They bought some fruit and bread. In the afternoon, Aziz and Malika came to Usmat. They drank tea and talked. Bekzod played football. Then Dilnoza read a book. She was tired, but she was happy."
      },
